case outcome_unknown_crash
kind negative
exec native-qemu
domain 2
needs tasks launch journal test-authority
# after an adapter crash every intent without an outcome is OUTCOME_UNKNOWN, nothing is replayed,
# and every earlier task id is STALE (ST8.3)
cap C => OK
bind B cap=C => OK
launch P bind=B : hang ! cat => OK
spawn T exit 0 bind=B => OK
run => OK
crash => OK
recover => OK unknown=3 replayed=0
wait T => STALE
waitp P => STALE
check empty
